# Lanterns: a short game made with VNext's samples (engine/sample: the cast, the places, the music, the menus), with a
# story of its own: three classmates, one night of lanterns under the cherry trees, and four endings. The build puts the
# samples and these files together and packs them as Lanterns' game.vnext, the demo on VNext's release page.
#
# Music: TERNOX (CC0, ternox.itch.io/vn-music). Pictures: drawn for VNext.

include characters
include story
include extras
include screens

setting title "Lanterns"
setting version "1.0"
setting developer yes
setting game_size 1920 1080
setting character_height 1
setting default.text_speed 45

setting time story
setting time_start Thursday 15:40

setting has_phone yes
setting phone_message_sound ping
setting phone_send_sound pop
setting phone_ringtone ring
setting phone_wallpaper phone_wallpaper
setting phone_lock_wallpaper phone_lock

variable name "Sam" "your name, as you type it on the Input screen"

# Thursday, after the last lesson.
scene start
    open title
    time Thursday 15:40
    show classroom as background with fade_in
    play music/after_school as music fade=2
    "Spring. Tomorrow night, the whole town walks under the cherry trees for the {tip lantern_festival}Lantern Festival{/tip}."
    "Everyone's going with someone. Everyone but me."
    "The last bell had rung. I was still at my desk, pretending to pack, when three people decided my evening for me."
    set name to ""
    open input
    if name is ""
        set name to "Sam"
    show kaede annoyed with slide_in
    Kaede annoyed: {name}! You still haven't signed up to help with the festival.
    Kaede calm: Someone has to hang the lanterns. Not that I care who you go with.
    choice
        "I'll help with the lanterns."
            set kaede.love to kaede.love + 1
            Kaede surprised: Oh. Good. That's... {italic}good{/italic}.
        "Are you asking me to go with you?"
            set kaede.love to kaede.love + 2
            camera with shake
            Kaede flustered: W-what?! {bold}As if!{/bold} I'm the class president, asking is my {italic}job{/italic}!
        "I'm busy tomorrow."
            Kaede cold: ...Fine. Do what you want.
    show kaede at left
    show haru calm at right with slide_in_right
    Haru: Is {name} here?
    Kaede surprised: S-senpai?
    Haru: The roof needs lanterns before tomorrow. You looked free.
    choice for 6 seconds
        "Help Haru on the roof"
            set helping to "haru"
            set haru.love to haru.love + 1
            Haru smile: ...Thanks. Tonight, then. I'll text you.
        "Stay and help Kaede"
            set helping to "kaede"
            set kaede.love to kaede.love + 1
            Kaede happy: Sorry, senpai! {name} is mine.{pause 0.6} For the cleanup!{pause 0.4} The {italic}cleanup{/italic}.
    if helping is ""
        "They both looked at me. I didn't say anything, and the moment passed."
        Haru: ...Another time, then.
    hide haru
    hide kaede
    show mika smile with fade_in
    Mika happy: {name}~! Walk home with me?
    Mika smile: I'll wait at the gate. However long it takes ♡
    Mika: Don't worry, I know the way to your house. We can't get lost.
    "...How does she know the way to my house?"
    hide mika
    if helping is "kaede"
        jump cleanup
    jump gate
